     "body": "<p>A prettier patch might be the following or something of the like:</p>\n\n<p>private File createTempDirectory(String name) </p>\n{\n\n        File directory = File.createTempFile(name, System.nanoTime(), System.getProperty(\"java.io.tmpdir\") );\n\n        directory.mkdir();\n        cleanOutDirectory(directory);\n        directory.deleteOnExit();\n        return directory;\n    }",
